        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1656360542295-e6b25b4e40e6?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3ODczODQ3NDd8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post posthog" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;posthogposthog&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog/posthog&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&#34;posthoglogo&#34; src=&#34;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/65415371/205059737-c8a4f836-4889-4654-902e-f302b187b6a0.png&#34;&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#39;https://posthog.com/contributors&#39;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;GitHub contributors&#34; src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/github/contributors/posthog/posthog&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#39;http://makeapullrequest.com&#39;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#39;PRs Welcome&#39; src=&#39;https://img.shields.io/badge/PRs-welcome-brightgreen.svg?style=shields&#39;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&#34;Docker Pulls&#34; src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/docker/pulls/posthog/posthog&#34;/&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/commits/master&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;GitHub commit activity&#34; src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/github/commit-activity/m/posthog/posthog&#34;/&gt; &lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20state%3Aclosed&#34;&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;GitHub closed issues&#34; src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/github/issues-closed/posthog/posthog&#34;/&gt; &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs&#34;&gt;Docs&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href=&#34;https://posthog.com/community&#34;&gt;Community&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href=&#34;https://posthog.com/roadmap&#34;&gt;Roadmap&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href=&#34;https://posthog.com/why&#34;&gt;Why PostHog?&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href=&#34;https://posthog.com/changelog&#34;&gt;Changelog&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.yml&#34;&gt;Bug reports&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1FZji2L-LmM&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://res.cloudinary.com/dmukukwp6/image/upload/demo_thumb_68d0d8d56d&#34; alt=&#34;PostHog Demonstration&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;posthog-is-the-open-source-platform-for-building-self-driving-products&#34;&gt;PostHog is the open source platform for building self-driving products
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog&lt;/a&gt; provides every tool you need to build a successful product, and captures all the context agents need to proactively diagnose problems, uncover opportunities, and ship fixes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/self-driving&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Self-driving mode&lt;/a&gt;: Turn signals in your product data (errors, rage clicks, failed queries, and more) into researched reports and pull requests you review and merge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/product-analytics&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Product analytics&lt;/a&gt;: Autocapture or manually instrument event-based analytics to understand user behavior and analyze data with visualization or SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/web-analytics&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Web analytics&lt;/a&gt;: Monitor web traffic and user sessions with a GA-like dashboard. Easily monitor conversion, web vitals, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/session-replay&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Session replays&lt;/a&gt;: Watch real user sessions of interactions with your website or mobile app to diagnose issues and understand user behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/feature-flags&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Feature flags&lt;/a&gt;: Safely roll out features to select users or cohorts with feature flags.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/experiments&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Experiments&lt;/a&gt;: Test changes and measure their statistical impact on goal metrics. Set up experiments with no-code too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/error-tracking&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Error tracking&lt;/a&gt;: Track errors, get alerts, and resolve issues to improve your product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/logs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Logs&lt;/a&gt;: Ingest, search, and analyze log data alongside the rest of your product data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/surveys&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Surveys&lt;/a&gt;: Ask anything with our collection of no-code survey templates, or build custom surveys with our survey builder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/data-warehouse&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Data warehouse&lt;/a&gt;: Sync data from external tools like Stripe, Hubspot, your data warehouse, and more. Query it alongside your product data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/cdp&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Data pipelines&lt;/a&gt;: Run custom filters and transformations on your incoming data. Send it to 25+ tools or any webhook in real time or batch export large amounts to your warehouse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/ai-observability&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;AI observability&lt;/a&gt;: Capture traces, generations, latency, and cost for your LLM-powered app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/workflows&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Workflows&lt;/a&gt;: Create workflows that automate actions or send messages to your users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can steer it all from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/slack&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Slack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;web&lt;/a&gt;, desktop (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/desktop&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog Desktop&lt;/a&gt;), or your own editor via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/mcp&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the MCP&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Best of all, all of this is free to use with a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/pricing&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;generous monthly free tier&lt;/a&gt; for each tool. Get started by signing up for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://us.posthog.com/signup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog Cloud US&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://eu.posthog.com/signup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog Cloud EU&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;table-of-contents&#34;&gt;Table of Contents
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#posthog-is-the-open-source-platform-for-building-self-driving-products&#34; &gt;PostHog is the open source platform for building self-driving products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#table-of-contents&#34; &gt;Table of Contents&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#getting-started-with-posthog&#34; &gt;Getting started with PostHog&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#posthog-cloud-recommended&#34; &gt;PostHog Cloud (Recommended)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#self-hosting-the-open-source-hobby-deploy-advanced&#34; &gt;Self-hosting the open-source hobby deploy (Advanced)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#setting-up-posthog&#34; &gt;Setting up PostHog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#learning-more-about-posthog&#34; &gt;Learning more about PostHog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#contributing&#34; &gt;Contributing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#open-source-vs-paid&#34; &gt;Open-source vs. paid&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;#were-hiring&#34; &gt;We’re hiring!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started-with-posthog&#34;&gt;Getting started with PostHog
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;posthog-cloud-recommended&#34;&gt;PostHog Cloud (Recommended)
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The fastest and most reliable way to get started with PostHog is signing up for free to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://us.posthog.com/signup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog Cloud&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://eu.posthog.com/signup&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PostHog Cloud EU&lt;/a&gt;. Your first 1 million events, 5k recordings, 1M flag requests, 100k exceptions, and 1500 survey responses are free every month, after which you pay based on usage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;self-hosting-the-open-source-hobby-deploy-advanced&#34;&gt;Self-hosting the open-source hobby deploy (Advanced)
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you want to self-host PostHog, you can deploy a hobby instance in one line on Linux with Docker (recommended 4GB memory):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;/bin/bash -c &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/posthog/posthog/HEAD/bin/deploy-hobby&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open source deployments should scale to approximately 100k events per month, after which we recommend &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/migrate/migrate-to-cloud&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;migrating to a PostHog Cloud&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We &lt;em&gt;do not&lt;/em&gt; provide customer support or offer guarantees for open source deployments. See our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/self-host&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;self-hosting docs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/self-host/deploy/troubleshooting&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;troubleshooting guide&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/self-host/open-source/disclaimer&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;disclaimer&lt;/a&gt; for more info.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;setting-up-posthog&#34;&gt;Setting up PostHog
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once you&amp;rsquo;ve got a PostHog instance, you can set it up by installing our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/getting-started/install?tab=snippet&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;JavaScript web snippet&lt;/a&gt;, one of &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/getting-started/install?tab=sdks&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our SDKs&lt;/a&gt;, or by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/getting-started/install?tab=api&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;using our API&lt;/a&gt;. You can also connect &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/mcp&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the MCP&lt;/a&gt; to bring PostHog into Claude Code, Cursor, or any MCP-compatible agent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have SDKs and libraries for popular languages and frameworks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Frontend&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Mobile&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Backend&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;JavaScript&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/react-native&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;React Native&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/python&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/next-js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Next.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/android&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Android&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/node&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Node&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/react&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;React&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/ios&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;iOS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/php&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PHP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/vue-js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Vue&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/flutter&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Flutter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/ruby&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Ruby&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond this, we have docs and guides for &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/go&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Go&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/dotnet&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;.NET/C#&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/django&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Django&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/angular&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Angular&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/wordpress&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;WordPress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/libraries/webflow&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Webflow&lt;/a&gt;, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once you&amp;rsquo;ve installed PostHog, see our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/product-os&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;product docs&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how to set up &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/product-analytics/capture-events&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;product analytics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/web-analytics/getting-started&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;web analytics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/session-replay/how-to-watch-recordings&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;session replays&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/feature-flags/creating-feature-flags&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;feature flags&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/experiments/creating-an-experiment&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;experiments&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/error-tracking/installation#setting-up-exception-autocapture&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;error tracking&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/surveys/installation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;surveys&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/cdp/sources&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;data warehouse&lt;/a&gt;, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;learning-more-about-posthog&#34;&gt;Learning more about PostHog
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our code isn&amp;rsquo;t the only thing that&amp;rsquo;s open source 😳. We also open source our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/handbook&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;company handbook&lt;/a&gt; which details our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/handbook/why-does-posthog-exist&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;strategy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/handbook/company/culture&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ways of working&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/handbook/team-structure&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;processes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curious about how to make the most of PostHog? We wrote a guide to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/new-to-posthog/getting-hogpilled&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;winning with PostHog&lt;/a&gt; which walks you through the basics of &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/new-to-posthog/activation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;measuring activation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/new-to-posthog/retention&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;tracking retention&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/docs/new-to-posthog/revenue&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;capturing revenue&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We &amp;lt;3 contributions big and small:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vote on features or get early access to beta functionality in our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/roadmap&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;roadmap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open a PR (see our instructions on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/handbook/engineering/developing-locally&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;developing PostHog locally&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Submit a feature request on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/roadmap&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our roadmap&lt;/a&gt; or a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/issues/new?assignees=&amp;amp;labels=bug&amp;amp;template=bug_report.yml&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;bug report&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For an overview of the codebase structure, see &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;docs/internal/monorepo-layout.md&#34; &gt;monorepo layout&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;products/README.md&#34; &gt;products&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;open-source-vs-paid&#34;&gt;Open-source vs. paid
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This repo is available under the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/blob/master/LICENSE&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;MIT expat license&lt;/a&gt;, except for the &lt;code&gt;ee&lt;/code&gt; directory (which has its &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog/blob/master/ee/LICENSE&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;license here&lt;/a&gt;) if applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Need &lt;em&gt;absolutely 💯% FOSS&lt;/em&gt;? Check out our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/PostHog/posthog-foss&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;posthog-foss&lt;/a&gt; repository, which is purged of all proprietary code and features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pricing for our paid plan is completely transparent and available on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/pricing&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;our pricing page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;were-hiring&#34;&gt;We&amp;rsquo;re hiring!
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://res.cloudinary.com/dmukukwp6/image/upload/v1/posthog.com/src/components/Home/images/mission-control-hog&#34; alt=&#34;Hedgehog working on a Mission Control Center&#34; width=&#34;350px&#34;/&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hey! If you&amp;rsquo;re reading this, you&amp;rsquo;ve proven yourself as a dedicated README reader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You might also make a great addition to our team. We&amp;rsquo;re growing fast &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://posthog.com/careers&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;and would love for you to join us&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
